  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/2428.png",
  "downloads": 1520,
  "favourites_count": 2,
  "description": "<h3><strong>RCTA - Rhea Ripley Miami [CODMW3]</strong></h3>\n<h3><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://i.postimg.cc/bJysdw3W/uncapped-Medal-TVEscape-From-Tarkov20241025055718-ezgif-com-optimize.gif\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/bJysdw3W/uncapped-Medal-TVEscape-From-Tarkov20241025055718-ezgif-com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"uncapped-Medal-TVEscape-From-Tarkov20241025055718-ezgif-com-optimize.gif\" /></a></h3>\n<p><strong>Mod Description</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>I have no comments, just know I’m saving you time and money from COD so be happy.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Mod Includes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Rhea Ripley Miami A [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Rhea Ripley Miami B [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Rhea Ripley Miami [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Rhea Ripley Miami A [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Rhea Ripley Miami Empty [Head] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Support</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Check out my other work on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://www.patreon.com/TRAPPUSSY</a></li>\n<li>Donate or maybe look into commissions on my <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://ko-fi.com/trappucci\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">https://ko-fi.com/trappucci</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Credits</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Infinity Ward, Sledgehammer Games</li>\n<li>GrooveypenguinX for framework</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Media</strong></p>\n",
